~D. The wrong bin placement is acceptable if the video is short.#Not correct. Step 1: reread the embedded source and identify the reporting goal, visual sequence, evidence, or accuracy need. Step 2: compare the option with the lesson model. This option is weak because it distracts from the report, removes needed evidence, creates an unclear sequence, weakens accuracy, or ignores audience understanding.
